// Copy this file to Local.xcconfig (git-ignored) in this same directory to
// sign builds with your own team and identity instead of the ad hoc
// default. This keeps your code signature stable across rebuilds, so
// macOS doesn't treat each build as a new app and re-ask for Screen
// Recording access.
//
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = YOUR_TEAM_ID
// CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY = Apple Development
